# Deposito - English
Module567892Name = Deposito
Module567892Desc = Deposits on returnable packaging: automatic deposit lines, returned empties back into stock, outstanding deposits
Permission56789201 = Read the report of outstanding deposits
DepositoDescription = Deposits on returnable packaging: automatic deposit lines, returned empties back into stock, outstanding deposits
DepositoDescriptionLong = A product can bring a deposit product along: on proposals, orders, invoices and TakePOS receipts the deposit line is added, follows the quantity and is removed with the product line. Returned empties are entered as a leeggoed product: Deposito stores the line as a refund so that Dolibarr's own stock logic puts the empties back into stock. Deposit and leeggoed lines have no VAT and no discount. A report shows the deposits still with customers.
DepositoReport = Outstanding deposits
DepositoReportHelp = Deposit charged minus empties returned on validated invoices and credit notes. Lines with a negative amount (returns) count negative. For the accounting side, give the deposit and leeggoed products a liability account as sales accounting code.
DepositoPerDeposit = Per product
DepositoPerCustomer = Per customer
DepositoUnitsOut = Units outstanding
DepositoAmountOut = Amount outstanding
DepositoDeposit = Deposit product
DepositoDepositHelp = Deposit product that is added automatically when this product is sold (e.g. bottle deposit)
DepositoQty = Deposit units per unit
DepositoQtyHelp = How many deposit units per unit of this product (e.g. 6 for a 6-pack). Empty = 1
DepositoReturn = Leeggoed (returned empty)
DepositoReturnHelp = Tick on the product of the returned empty (bottle, crate). On a receipt or invoice it is always a refund and goes back into stock; 0% VAT, no discount. The price may be entered positive or negative.
DepositoAuto = Deposit line of
DepositoSetup = Deposito setup
DepositoSetupHelp = Everything is set on the product cards: a drink gets a deposit product, a returned empty gets the Leeggoed checkbox. This page checks the setup.
